# Local-only personal and machine content — never published to the public repository.
# These three are untracked directories, so the npm tarball whitelist already excludes them;
# nothing constrained `git add -A`. See docs/PUBLICATION.md for the full publication inventory
# and for each privacy decision. Excluding them keeps the local originals — it never deletes them.
#   professor-skills/ : personal profile, real course registry, learning-state snapshots
#   .serena/          : local language-server tooling state (project.yml, symbol cache)
#   docs/qa/          : dated QA evidence with run-specific absolute paths and model outputs
professor-skills/
.serena/
docs/qa/
